[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:97. A Small Blue Case]
[00:01.060]Lesson 97. | 第97课。
[00:03.330]I left a suitcase on the train to London the other day. | 前几天我把一个手提箱忘在了去伦敦的火车上。
[00:08.385]Can you describe it, sir? | 您能描述一下它吗，先生？
[00:10.250]It's a small blue case and it's got a zip. | 它是一个小的蓝色箱子，上面有拉链。
[00:14.575]There's a label on the handle with my name and address on it. | 把手上有一个标签，上面有我的姓名和地址。
[00:19.310]Is this case yours? | 这个箱子是您的吗？
[00:21.790]No, that's not mine. | 不，那不是我的。
[00:24.215]What about this one? | 这个呢？
[00:26.530]This one's got a label. | 这个上面有标签。
[00:28.540]Let me see it. | 让我看看。
[00:30.650]What's your name and address? | 您的姓名和地址是什么？
[00:33.360]David Hall, 83 Bridge Street. | 大卫·霍尔，布里奇街83号。
[00:37.220]That's right. | 对了。
[00:38.550]D N Hall, 83 Bridge Street. | D. N. 霍尔，布里奇街83号。
[00:43.135]Five shillings, please. | 请付五先令。
[00:45.650]Here you are. | 给你。
[00:46.885]Thank you. | 谢谢。
[00:48.300]Hey! | 嘿！
[00:49.700]What's the matter? | 怎么了？
[00:51.085]This case doesn't belong to me. | 这个箱子不是我的。
[00:54.150]You've given me the wrong case. | 你给我拿错了箱子。
[00:57.680]Lesson 99. | 第99课。
[01:01.305]Oh! | 噢！
[01:04.295]What's the matter, Ted? | 怎么了，特德？
[01:06.945]I slipped and fell downstairs. | 我滑倒了，摔下了楼。
[01:10.215]Have you hurt yourself? | 你伤到自己了吗？
[01:12.360]Yes, I have. | 是的，我伤到了。
[01:14.020]I think that I've hurt my back. | 我想我伤到了背。
[01:17.080]Try and stand up. | 试着站起来。
[01:19.615]Can you stand up? | 你能站起来吗？
[01:21.710]Here, let me help you. | 来，我来帮你。
[01:24.890]I'm sorry, Pat. | 对不起，帕特。
[01:27.060]I'm afraid that I can't get up. | 我恐怕站不起来。
[01:30.150]I think that the doctor had better see you. | 我想你最好让医生看看。
[01:33.675]I'll telephone Doctor Carter. | 我给卡特医生打电话。
[01:36.905]The doctor says that he will come at once. | 医生说他会马上过来。
[01:40.750]I'm sure that you need an X-ray, Ted. | 我确信你需要拍X光，特德。